{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:51:46.238Z","type":"command","turn":15,"text":"lift rug"}
{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:51:46.239Z","type":"output","turn":15,"text":"The rug is too heavy to lift, but in trying to take it you have noticed an irregularity beneath it.","status_line":"Living Room                                               Score: 10  Moves: 14","score":10}
