{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:51:47.774Z","type":"output","turn":16,"text":"With a great effort, the rug is moved to one side of the room, revealing the dusty cover of a closed trap door.","status_line":"Living Room                                               Score: 10  Moves: 15","score":10}
